            '#column':: d.obj(help='"A List of columns that should be exposed as individual fields as opposed to a list of (column name, value) pairs. All columns whose qualifier matches a qualifier in this list can be accessed as Other columns can be accessed as a list through column field.  Structure is documented below."'),
